==Finnish==

===Etymology===
*From the Finno-Ugric root *''ede'' (that was some time ago maybe a noun, see the "inflection" below).

===Pronunciation===
*Hyphenation: e•si

===Prefix===
'''esi-'''
#[[pre-]], [[fore-]].

====Inflection====
*The original cases of ''esi-'' serve in modern Finnish only as adverbs.
